This is the Den Den live system. To install Den Den, connect to the internet
and run:

    denden-install

It asks which disk to use, and can install into free space beside Windows.

For Wi-Fi, authenticate to the wireless network using the iwctl utility.
Ethernet and Wi-Fi interfaces using DHCP connect automatically.

Claude Code (claude), Codex (codex) and T3 Code (t3) are available here too.
